This product contains modified versions of the `files` and `image-viewer` mods
shipped with the Herdr app 0.1.13, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Changes to `files` (now `files-plus`):
- images open in the `image-viewer-plus` dialog, with the folder's other images
- audio plays in a bar at the bottom of the panel (media.js, ffplay)
- video opens in the system player or ffplay; HTML opens in the browser
- files on another machine are copied in chunks, with a download progress bar
- Markdown files open as a rendered preview with a Source / Preview toggle
- right-click menu: rename, new file, new folder, move to the Trash
- text files are editable and saved, also on another machine

Changes to `image-viewer` (now `image-viewer-plus`):
- images on another machine, copied in chunks
- pixel size on macOS (sips) and Linux (file), so 100 % and zoom work there
- the `files` prop: step through a folder's images with ← and →
